1d:["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-xl border border-git-border bg-git-card p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-sans text-xl font-bold text-git-bright border-b border-git-border/60 pb-3","children":"Architecture & Overview"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-invert max-w-none text-sm text-git-text space-y-4 font-sans leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"Ultra-minimalist focus timer and task engine designed for deep work sessions."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-lg border border-git-border bg-git-canvas p-4 font-mono text-xs text-git-muted whitespace-pre-wrap","children":"\n# Focus Flow\n\nFocus Flow is built for engineers and creators who need uninterrupted concentration blocks.\n\n## Core Features\n\n- **Adaptive Pomodoro Cycles**: Automatically tailors break times based on focus history.\n- **System-level DND Sync**: Toggles OS focus modes across phone and desktop simultaneously.\n- **Git Commit Sync**: Optionally logs your focused time blocks straight to your daily commit graph.\n- **Offline First**: All data remains on-device with optional encrypted iCloud/GDrive backup.\n"}]]}]]}]
